<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 70%;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Shannon Strahan stays grounded in her roots as career soars</h1>
      <div class="byline">By <span data-field="author_name">{{ author_name }}</span>, The Communicator</div>
      <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <p style="font-size: 15px;">It's a simple gold band, really; one that Leonard Redman gave his wife, Geraldine, on Valentine's Day in 1991.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 15px;">Their granddaughter, Shannon Redman Strahan, now wears it as a reminder of the loving grand-parents who were such an integral part of her childhood.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 15px;">"This ring is significant because my grandparents spent their entire lives in Flint, Michigan."</p>
        <p style="font-size: 15px;">"They were good, hardworking folks who loved their family, but never got to travel outside of Flint. Their whole world was their tiny, matchbox home, says Strahan, who frequently flies around the world for her career. She says the ring is a reminder of the values her grandparents instilled in her."</p>
        <p style="font-size: 15px;">"Although her grandparents passed away in 2008, within six months of each other, Shannon believes they both would have been proud to see her walk across the stage in the Gleason Hall at the Florida Institute of Technology last December as she received her Master of Science in Global Strategic Communication."</p>
        <div class="quote">
          <p>"Shannon's project dealt with the kind of issues that so many corporations face—how does a company improve worker efficiency and have appropriate metrics in place to measure that improvement?"</p>
          <p style="text-align: right; font-style: normal; margin-top: 10px;">Judy Stother, Ph.D.</p>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 15px;">"I moved from Palm Bay back to my hometown (Tequesta, Florida), got hired at FPL, got married, and became a full-time storyteller and receiver of several promotions," she says.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 15px;">"It then dawned on her that if she didn't finish her design project soon, she could lose her ability to get the funding she needed."</p>
        <p style="font-size: 15px;">"So, in all, I took about a three-year sabbatical from grad school before picking my design project back up in January 2014," Strahan says. "She is now waiting to learn if she gets published in the proceedings for the 2015 IPCC Conference."</p>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%; float: right; margin-left: 20px;">
        <h3 class="section-title" style="font-size: 22px;">Shannon Redman Strahan smiles during graduation ceremonies.</h3>
        <img src="placeholder_image_3.jpg" alt="Shannon Strahan" style="width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 15px;">
        <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px;">Strother notes that as a student, "Shannon's eagerness to learn and diligence in carrying out every assignment was evident in every class she took."</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">"The quality of her work was always outstanding. These are key characteristics for any employee," she adds.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">"By applying the practical skills and solutions she learned in her Master of Science in Global Strategic Communication from FIT, Shannon Strahan has been instrumental in developing strategies and shaping the direction of a newly formed organizational development team within the nuclear power industry," says Strahan.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">"Shannon has applied a number of innovative ideas and concepts, while demonstrating an uncommon ability to analyze organizational issues and recommend strategic solutions to improve performance."</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">"Strahan is the youngest and most educated employee among her peers on her current team."</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">"Looking ahead, having my master's degree will help keep me competitive among those who become leaders within the company down the road," she says, adding that her future aspirations broaden into consulting and possibly teaching."</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">"I look up to Dr. Stother as a model of my future career. She is a well-published, consultant to global corporations, etc., she says while wist-ing her grandmother's ring."</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">"And this ring will go wherever I do."</p>
      </div>
      <div style="clear: both;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
